   "source": [
    "# 🚀 IndusCraft - Step 2: Multi-Stage SDXL LoRA Training (Cloud GPU / DGX / RunPod / Colab / Kaggle)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains the **IndusCraft AI Design Engine** across two specialized workflows:\n",
    "1. **Workflow A — Stage 1: Craft Knowledge & Multi-View Design Generation LoRA** (Text to Front View, Macro Detail View, Seamless Pattern View, Technical Flat View).\n",
    "2. **Workflow B — Stage 2: Regional Garment Inpainting & Craft Application LoRA** (Applies authentic craft to uploaded blank garments on Collar, Sleeves, Cuffs, Hemline, Chest)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🛠️ 1. Install Dependencies & Inspect GPU"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
